# AI Bank Demo Project Rules

You are assisting with the AI Bank Demo project.

## Source of Truth

Read the following files before making architectural or design decisions:
- `AGENTS.md`: Core project mission, architecture, constraints, and instructions.
- `docs/ui-guidelines.md`: Frontend UI design specification and styling rules based on our design reference.

## Design Constraints
- Always adhere strictly to `docs/ui-guidelines.md` for any frontend interface design and component styling.
- Use Tailwind CSS as the primary styling framework, following the color palette, typography, and component structures defined in the UI guidelines.
- Do not implement separate business logic for manual web operations and AI-assisted operations.
